      "post_id": "2081467577885425939",
      "url": "https://x.com/SLS_0x/status/2081467577885425939",
      "text": "@OpenAI’s ChatGPT web just “confessed” the exact execution-path split we kept running into while building VOOL:\n\nSOL 5.6 in Codex/ChatGPT via ChatGPT login ≠ SOL 5.6 via API key.\nSame model label. Different execution path—and, in our repeated real-world testing, materially different output quality.\n\n“Third-brother mode”** is real enough to measure.\n\nThat means a model name alone tells you very little. The app, endpoint, harness, context handling and hidden limits can change the actual product you get.\n\n@AnthropicAI users: are you seeing the same split between Claude App and API/CLI? We haven’t noticed it ourselves so far.\n\n**Same model badge. Temu-grade execution path.",
      "original_text": "@OpenAI’s ChatGPT web just “confessed” the exact execution-path split we kept running into while building VOOL:\n\nSOL 5.6 in Codex/ChatGPT via ChatGPT login ≠ SOL 5.6 via API key.\nSame model label. Different execution path—and, in our repeated real-world testing, materially different output quality.\n\n“Third-brother mode”** is real enough to measure.\n\nThat means a model name alone tells you very little. The app, endpoint, harness, context handling and hidden limits can change the actual product you get.\n\n@AnthropicAI users: are you seeing the same split between Claude App and API/CLI? We haven’t noticed it ourselves so far.\n\n**Same model badge. Temu-grade execution path.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "@OpenAI 的 ChatGPT 网页版刚刚“承认”了我们在构建 VOOL 时一直遇到的确切执行路径分裂：\n\n通过 ChatGPT 登录在 Codex/ChatGPT 中使用的 SOL 5.6 ≠ 通过 API key 使用的 SOL 5.6。\n同一个模型标签。不同的执行路径——而且在我们反复进行的真实世界测试中，输出质量有实质性差异。\n\n“第三兄弟模式”** 足够真实，已经可以被测量。\n\n这意味着单凭一个模型名称并不能告诉你多少信息。应用、端点、测试框架、上下文处理和隐藏限制都可能改变你实际得到的产品。\n\n@AnthropicAI 用户：你们是否也看到 Claude App 和 API/CLI 之间存在同样的分裂？到目前为止我们自己还没有注意到。\n\n**同一个模型徽章。Temu级别的执行路径。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
